  "title": "Motion principles",
  "group": "Motion",
  "order": 1,
  "summary": {
    "en": "Calm by default: things arrive on a spring with no overshoot, leave faster on an accelerating curve, start from wherever they are when interrupted, and only bounce after a gesture that carried momentum. Every value comes from a token; the recipes in this group say which one.",
    "id": "Tenang secara bawaan: elemen tiba dengan spring tanpa overshoot, pergi lebih cepat dengan kurva yang makin cepat, mulai dari posisi mana pun saat diinterupsi, dan hanya memantul setelah gestur yang membawa momentum. Setiap nilai berasal dari token; resep di grup ini menyebut token yang dipakai."
  },
  "titleId": "Motion principles",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Enter slow, leave fast",
        "desc": "The menu grows from its trigger on the smooth spring (560 ms, no overshoot) and leaves in 180 ms on the exit curve. Opening is information; closing should get out of the way.",
        "html": "<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block;\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn--gray btn--md\" data-lds-menu=\"mp-menu\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Sort reports<span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n  <div class=\"menu\" id=\"mp-menu\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); left: 0;\">\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">event</span>Date reported</button>\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">label</span>Service type</button>\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">schedule</span>Recently added</button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Interruptible",
        "desc": "Click quickly between the options. The thumb never finishes a stale trip: each click redirects it from where it is, because it is a CSS transition, not a keyframe animation.",
        "html": "<div class=\"seg seg--lg\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Range\" data-lds-segmented style=\"width: 340px;\">\n  <span class=\"seg__thumb\"></span>\n  <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Week</button>\n  <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Month</button>\n  <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Quarter</button>\n  <button class=\"seg__btn\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Year</button>\n</div>"
      },
      {
