"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 14 14\"><path class=\"tick\" d=\"M2.5 7.4 L5.7 10.4 L11.5 3.8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"check__text\">Perlu tindak lanjut</span></label>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--block\" style=\"margin-top: auto;\" data-lds-close>Tampilkan 12 hasil</button>\n  </aside>\n</div>"
